# As of v1.4, actual simulator/emulator devices (not just their caches) are an
# opt-in choice, asked once up front -- see WIPE_DEVICES below. Pure build
# caches (DerivedData, CoreSimulator/Gradle caches, each tool's own app cache)
# always run regardless of that answer -- only the device/runtime wipe itself
# (iOS simulators + runtime images + DeviceSupport, Android AVDs + SDK
# emulator images) is gated on it.
